# Topic 1 · Gender Studies and the Social Construction of Gender

::: glance | Topic 1 at a glance
**Heads I and II** of the syllabus. Second-heaviest topic: ==16.5 visits== (16 full questions and one short note, 2016–2026). Four discipline families — Women's vs Gender Studies, multidisciplinary nature, autonomy vs integration, status in Pakistan — have been asked fourteen times between them, often two in one question. The construction half is rising in difficulty: theories (2016), deconstruction and language (2020), natural or social (2021), is sex constructed (2024), queer theory and the transgender law (2026). The discipline half has been silent since 2023 and is due.
:::

